{"unit":8,"no":31,"title":"Things you have done","blurb":"Unit 8","VOCAB":[["go to a music festival","","на музыкальный фестиваль","музыка фестиваліне бару",""],["go to a concert","","на концерт","концертке бару",""],["go to an art gallery","","в галерею","көрме галереясына бару",""],["go to the opera","","в оперу","операға бару",""],["see a play","","посмотреть спектакль","қойылым көру",""],["see a musical","","посмотреть мюзикл","мюзикл көру",""],["play an instrument","","играть на инструменте","аспапта ойнау",""],["play in a band","","играть в группе","топта ойнау",""],["have singing lessons","","брать уроки вокала","ән сабағын алу",""],["win","","выиграть","жеңу",""],["learn","","выучить","үйрену",""],["perform","","выступать","өнер көрсету",""],["ever","","когда-либо","бір рет болса да",""],["never","","никогда","ешқашан",""]],"SLIDES":[["🌍","He has given concerts all over the world."]],"PICWORDS":["go to a music festival","go to a concert","go to an art gallery","go to the opera","see a play","see a musical","play an instrument","play in a band","have singing lessons","win","learn","perform","ever","never"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"12_5":"A1_L31_12_5.mp3","12_3":"A1_L31_12_3.mp3","12_9":"A1_L31_12_9.mp3","12_1":"A1_L31_12_1.mp3"},"SEGS":{"12_5":[3.71,null],"12_3":[3.65,null],"12_9":[3.56,null],"12_1":[3.65,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>Things you have done</h2>\n      <p>Talk about what you have — and haven't — done in your life.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes, top to bottom.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">In your whole life — have you ever…?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap everything you have done, at least once.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>🎤</b> &nbsp;sung karaoke</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🎬</b> &nbsp;left the cinema early</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🎸</b> &nbsp;played an instrument</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🏆</b> &nbsp;won a competition</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🎭</b> &nbsp;seen a musical</div><div class=\"card\"><b>✈️</b> &nbsp;flown on a plane</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">These are your experience words for this lesson.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('12_5',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 12.5 — culture and free-time activities</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">go to the cinema / the theatre · go to a music festival · go to a salsa class · go to art galleries · go to a rock concert / a classical music concert · go to the opera · see a film · see a play · see a musical · play the guitar · play in a band · have music / painting / dance / drawing / singing lessons</div></details>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">go, see, play or have? Choose.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s3SSt1\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ to a music festival\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">see</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">play</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ a musical\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">play</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">see</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ in a band\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">play</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">see</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">___ singing lessons\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">see</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">has</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">___ a competition\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">learn</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">win</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">___ on a stage for the first time\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">see</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">perform</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>go to a festival · see a musical · play in a band · have lessons · win a competition · perform.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Match the verb to the experience.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Tap a verb, then tap its partner.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\"><b>Verb</b> &rarr; <b>Experience</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s3GRt3\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>go to</b> <select data-answer=\"a music festival\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>see</b> <select data-answer=\"a musical\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>play</b> <select data-answer=\"in a band\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>have</b> <select data-answer=\"singing lessons\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>win</b> <select data-answer=\"a competition\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>perform</b> <select data-answer=\"on a stage\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Match the verb to the experience.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Tap a verb, then tap its partner.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\"><b>Verb</b> &rarr; <b>Experience</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s3OOt5\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>go to</b> <select data-answer=\"a music festival\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>see</b> <select data-answer=\"a musical\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>play</b> <select data-answer=\"in a band\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>have</b> <select data-answer=\"singing lessons\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>win</b> <select data-answer=\"a competition\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>perform</b> <select data-answer=\"on a stage\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"a music festival\">a music festival</option><option value=\"a musical\">a musical</option><option value=\"in a band\">in a band</option><option value=\"singing lessons\">singing lessons</option><option value=\"a competition\">a competition</option><option value=\"on a stage\">on a stage</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">have + done — your life experience.</div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('12_3',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 12.3 — four sentences</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 He's sold them all over the world. 2 He hasn't opened a gallery in New York. 3 This hasn't stopped her dream of dancing. 4 Thousands of people have watched her.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s4t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">“He's sold them all over the world.” — the strong word is…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">he's</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">sold</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">he've</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“He hasn't opened a gallery.” — the strong word is…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">opened</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">hasn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">sold</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Positive → stress the participle (SOLD). Negative → stress <b>hasn't</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“He <b>has given</b> concerts all over the world.”</div><div>“She<b>'s had</b> dance lessons.”</div><div>“I <b>haven't eaten</b> sushi.”</div><div>“<b>Have you ever been</b> to Iceland?” — “Yes, I <b>have</b>.”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> these sentences are about life experience — but do they say WHEN it happened?</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th>Form</th><th>Example</th></tr><tr><td>Positive</td><td class=\"pos\">I<b>'ve played</b> in a band. · She<b>'s had</b> dance lessons. · He <b>has given</b> concerts all over the world.</td></tr><tr><td>Negative</td><td class=\"pos\">I <b>haven't eaten</b> sushi. · He <b>hasn't seen</b> the written music.</td></tr><tr><td>Question</td><td class=\"pos\"><b>Have you ever been</b> to Iceland? — Yes, I <b>have</b>. / No, I <b>haven't</b>.</td></tr><tr><td>Participles</td><td>regular: play → play<b>ed</b> · irregular: go → <b>been/gone</b> · see → <b>seen</b> · win → <b>won</b> · write → <b>written</b> · eat → <b>eaten</b></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>Use the Present Perfect for life experience — no exact time: I've been to London (sometime in my life).</div><div>Build: <b>have/has + past participle</b>. Regular participles = the -ed form; irregular are new words (seen, won, written, been).</div><div><b>ever</b> in questions: Have you <b>ever</b>…? <b>never</b> in negatives: I've <b>never</b> left early.</div><div>With an exact time (last summer, in 2010) English uses the Past Simple — that contrast is Lesson 32.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Practice\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Practice</div>\n      <h2>Practice</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 — Build the Present Perfect.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s5t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ never eaten sushi.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ had dance lessons.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ you ever been to London?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Did</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">have</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ seen the written music. (negative)\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">doesn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">hasn't</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">They ___ played in a band together.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">'s</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">have</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">'ve</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">Have you ever won a prize? — Yes, I ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">won</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">have</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>I/you/we/they → have ('ve) · he/she → has ('s) · short answer repeats have.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s5t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I have saw that film three times.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I have seen that film three times.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I have see that film three times.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I has seen that film three times.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Have you ever went to the opera?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Have you ever been to the opera?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Have you ever go to the opera?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Have you ever gos to the opera?</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “She have won many prizes.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">She haves won many prizes.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">She have won many prizes.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">She has won many prizes.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>see → <b>seen</b> · go → <b>been</b> (in Have-you-ever questions) · she <b>has</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">see → saw → ___\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sawn</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">seen</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">won</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">win → won → ___\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">won</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">winned</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">seen</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">write → wrote → ___\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">written</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">wrote</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">seen</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">eat → ate → ___\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">eaten</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">ate</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">eated</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>seen · won · written · eaten — the third forms of your old irregular friends.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Cinema\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Cinema</div>\n      <h2>Cinema</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Four honest answers to one question.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then match the person to the answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('12_9',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 12.9 — have you ever left the cinema early?</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">I: Have you ever left the cinema early? S1: Oh yes! I've left in the middle of a lot of films. I don't want to sit watching something really bad — life's too short! S2: I've never left the cinema early, but I've often wanted to. A few months ago, I went to see a terrible film. Someone walked out every five minutes. At the end of the film, I was the only person left! S3: Yes, I have. I walked out once — it was last summer and it was a beautiful day. The film was really boring, so I just decided to leave. S4: No, I haven't, but I've fallen asleep in a lot of cinemas! When the lights go out and the seats are comfortable, I just can't stay awake. I've never walked out of a film, though. I think it's rude to other people.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Speaker 1…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">has never left the cinema.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">has left a lot of films — life's too short.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">have left a lot of films — life's too short.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Speaker 2…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">left last summer.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">has never left — once she was the last person in the room!</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">have never left — once she was the last person in the room!</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Speaker 3…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">walked out once, last summer, on a beautiful day.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">always sleeps in the cinema.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">walked out once, last summer, on an beautiful day.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Speaker 4…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">hates films.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">have never walked out — but has fallen asleep a lot.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">has never walked out — but has fallen asleep a lot.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>S1 leaves often · S2 never (but wanted!) · S3 once, last summer · S4 never walks out — just sleeps.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Pianist\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Pianist</div>\n      <h2>Pianist</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Nobuyuki Tsujii — the man who did the impossible.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then choose True or False.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('12_1',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 12.1 — Nobuyuki Tsujii</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">Nobuyuki Tsujii was born blind, but he started playing on a toy piano at the age of just two. He began learning the piano two years later, and he gave his first big concert in Tokyo when he was twelve years old. He's in his twenties now, but he has given concerts all over the world, and he has won many prizes and international competitions. He has written music for film and TV, too. He hasn't seen the written music, but he has learnt to play some of the most difficult pieces of music in the world only through sound. His classical music fans have said this is amazing.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s7t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">He was born blind.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">He gave his first big concert in Tokyo at twelve.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">He has never won a prize.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He has learnt the most difficult music only through sound.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Born blind · Tokyo at 12 · he <b>has won many prizes</b> · and learnt everything by ear.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write your life list: five things you have done — and one dream.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">Use I've…, I've never…, and one going to.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>I've been to…</li><li>I've seen / won / played…</li><li>I've never…</li><li>…but I've always wanted to</li><li>One day I'm going to…</li><li>three times / many times</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Have-you-ever bingo.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Find experiences you share — and ones only your partner has.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>Have you ever…?</li><li>Yes, I have. / No, I haven't.</li><li>I've never…, but I've always wanted to</li><li>When was it?</li><li>It was last year…</li><li>He's / She's never…</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Have-you-ever bingo.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Find experiences you share — and ones only your teacher has.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>Have you ever…?</li><li>Yes, I have. / No, I haven't.</li><li>I've never…, but I've always wanted to</li><li>When was it?</li><li>It was last year…</li><li>He's / She's never…</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — ask your partner six Have you ever…? questions: sung karaoke? won a prize? seen a musical? played in a band? left the cinema early? eaten something very strange?</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — for every YES, ask one more question (When? Where?). Notice: the answer with a time goes to the Past Simple!</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — report the best discovery to another pair: “She has performed on a real stage!”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — ask your teacher six Have you ever…? questions: sung karaoke? won a prize? seen a musical? played in a band? left the cinema early? eaten something very strange?</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — for every YES, ask one more question (When? Where?). Notice: the answer with a time goes to the Past Simple!</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — report the best discovery to your teacher: “She has performed on a real stage!”</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s9t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ won many prizes. (perfect)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"has\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Have you ever ___ to a concert? (be)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"been\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I have ___ eaten sushi. (at no time)<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"never\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>have/has + third form: has won, have been, haven't seen \\u00b7 ever/never for experience.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s9t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She have won many prizes.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She has won many prizes.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Have you ever went to a concert?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Have you ever been to a concert?\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I haven't saw that film.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I haven't seen that film.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>have/has + third form: has won, have been, haven't seen \\u00b7 ever/never for experience.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l31s9t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Say the experience: I / visit London<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I have visited London.|I've visited London.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: you / ever / eat sushi<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Have you ever eaten sushi?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Say it with NEVER: He / fly<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"He has never flown.|He's never flown.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>have/has + third form: has won, have been, haven't seen \\u00b7 ever/never for experience.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 11 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}